flowchart LR
    subgraph study[Paper workflow: studied reference, not our implementation]
        Bank[Fixed bank of valid reset configurations]
        History[Recent Boolean success outcomes per configuration]
        SGS[Success-guided reset selection]
        Parallel[Parallel environments and policy rollouts]
        PPO[PPO policy updates]
        Bank -->|Available starting states| SGS
        History -->|Estimated success rates| SGS
        SGS -->|Selected reset on episode boundary| Parallel
        Parallel -->|Episode outcomes| History
        Parallel -->|On-policy transitions| PPO
        PPO -->|Policy actions| Parallel
    end
    subgraph proposal[ABC and R1 Lite: proposed handoffs only]
        Leela[Leela: validated scene and reset artifacts]
        Sadhana[Sadhana: training reset allocation]
        Learner[Separately named learner condition]
        Heldout[Fresh full-task evaluation: no sampler updates]
        Leela -.->|Versioned state bank| Sadhana
        Sadhana -.->|Training configurations| Learner
        Learner -.->|Frozen policy| Heldout
    end
    Root[Root: design and evidence acceptance] -.-> study
    Peer[FastTD3 peer: equations and release audit] -.-> SGS
    SGS -.->|Design inspiration; not a tested transfer| Sadhana
